<title>MEXICO: Cemex Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Cemex Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		   Q2 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		 1.08			n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		 1.341 bln		 2.701 bln</p>
<p>     Revs		6.232 bln		 6.075 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit    2.398 bln		 2.391 bln</p>
<p>     Oper profit     1.435 bln		 1.530 bln</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   469.68 million	     1.599 bln</p>
<p>	    Int paid    994.81 million	     1.252 bln</p>
<p>	    FX loss     21.78 million		1.846 bln</p>
<p>	    Int earned  66.49 million		121.59 million</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    1.420 bln		2.914 bln</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Cemex SA.</p>
<p>((--David Luhnow, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9656))</p>
